.TH mm2_align 1 "18 February 2026" "minimap2-2.24" "Bioinformatics tools"
.SH NAME
.PP
mm2_align \- perform base-level alignment for minimap2 staged pipeline
.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
.B mm2_align
.RB [ -x
.IR preset ]
.RB [ options ]
.I reference.fa
.I query.fa
.B -c
.I chains.json
.B -o
.I output.json
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
.B mm2_align
is a CLI tool that performs the alignment (DP extension) stage of the
minimap2 mapping pipeline. It takes chains (from
.BR mm2_chain (1))
and extends them into full base-level alignments with CIGAR strings.
.PP
This tool supports GPU acceleration for alignment via the
.B --use-gpu
option. Unlike GPU chaining, GPU alignment does not require a
configuration file.
.PP
For end-to-end alignment workflows, use
.BR minimap2 (1)
instead.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Required arguments
.TP 10
.I reference.fa
Reference FASTA file.
.TP
.I query.fa
Query FASTA/FASTQ file.
.TP
.BI -c \ FILE
Input chains JSON file (produced by
.BR mm2_chain (1)).
.TP
.BI -o \ FILE
Output JSON file.
.SS Preset
.TP 10
.BI -x \ STR
Preset configuration. Available presets:
.BR map-ont ,
.BR map-pb ,
.BR map-hifi ,
.BR asm5 / asm10 / asm20 ,
.BR sr ,
.BR splice .
.SS Indexing options
.TP 10
.BI -k \ INT
K-mer size [15].
.TP
.BI -w \ INT
Minimizer window size [10].
.SS Alignment scoring options
.TP 10
.BI -A \ INT
Matching score [2].
.TP
.BI -B \ INT
Mismatch penalty [4]. Use a larger value for lower divergence.
.TP
.BI -O \ INT[,INT]
Gap open penalty [4,24]. If the second value is not specified, it is
set to the first value. A gap of length
.I k
costs
.RI min{ O1 + k * E1 ,
.IR O2 + k * E2 }.
.TP
.BI -E \ INT[,INT]
Gap extension penalty [2,1].
.TP
.BI -z \ INT[,INT]
Z-drop score and inversion Z-drop score [400,200]. Truncate an
alignment if the running alignment score drops too quickly along the
diagonal of the DP matrix.
.TP
.BI -s \ INT
Minimum DP alignment score [40]. The peak score is computed from the
final CIGAR.
.SS GPU options
.TP 10
.B --use-gpu
Enable GPU acceleration for alignment. No configuration file is required.
.SS Other options
.TP 10
.B -h
Show help message.
.SH OUTPUT FORMAT
.PP
Output is a JSON file containing alignments with CIGAR strings:
.PP
.nf
{
  "queries": [{
    "name": "read1",
    "alignments": [{
      "mapq": 60,
      "cigar": "800M",
      "qs": 0, "qe": 800,
      "rs": 1000, "re": 1800
    }]
  }]
}
.fi
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Basic alignment with ONT preset:
.PP
.RS 4
.B mm2_align -x map-ont ref.fa reads.fq -c chains.json -o align.json
.RE
.PP
GPU-accelerated alignment:
.PP
.RS 4
.B mm2_align --use-gpu ref.fa reads.fq -c chains.json -o align.json
.RE
.PP
Custom scoring parameters:
.PP
.RS 4
.B mm2_align -A 1 -B 2 -O 2,10 -E 1,1 -z 200,100 ref.fa reads.fq -c chains.json -o out.json
.RE
.PP
Full staged pipeline:
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
mm2_seed -x map-ont ref.fa reads.fq -o seeds.json
mm2_chain -x map-ont ref.fa -s seeds.json -o chains.json
mm2_align -x map-ont ref.fa reads.fq -c chains.json -o align.json
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.PP
mm2_seed(1), mm2_chain(1), minimap2(1)
